            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"astro-sckkx6r4\"> <head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"> <title>Epic Film &amp; TV Soundtracks – A Candlelit Experience tickets - London | Fever</title><meta id=\"description\" name=\"description\" content=\"Epic film &#38; TV soundtracks performed live in an intimate candlelit setting. Get your tickets now!\"><link id=\"canonical\" rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/569419\"><link id=\"alternate:en\" rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/569419\" hreflang=\"x-default\"><link id=\"alternate:en\" rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/569419\" hreflang=\"en\"><link id=\"alternate:es\" rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/569419/es\" hreflang=\"es\"><meta id=\"robots\" name=\"robots\" content=\"index\"><meta name=\"google\" content=\"notranslate\"><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"><meta name=\"mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\"><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\"><meta id=\"al:ios:url\" property=\"al:ios:url\" content=\"fb212044188860269://m/569419\"><meta id=\"al:android:url\" property=\"al:android:url\" content=\"fb212044188860269://m/569419\"><meta id=\"al:android:package\" property=\"al:android:package\" content=\"com.feverup.fever\"><link id=\"apple-touch-icon\" rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"/favicons/apple-touch-icon.png\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"48x48\" href=\"/favicons/favicon-48x48.png\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"/favicons/favicon-32x32.png\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"16x16\" href=\"/favicons/favicon-16x16.png\"><link rel=\"mask-icon\" href=\"/favicons/favicon-safari-pinned-tab.svg\" color=\"#10212e\"><link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/favicons/shortcut-favicon.ico\"><meta name=\"msapplication-config\" content=\"/browserconfig.xml\"><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://applications-media.feverup.com\"><meta name=\"msapplication-TileColor\" content=\"#10212e\"><meta name=\"msapplication-config\" content=\"/browserconfig.xml\"><meta property=\"fb:app_id\" content=\"212044188860269\"><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Fever\"><meta id=\"og:type\" property=\"og:type\" content=\"product\"><meta id=\"og:title\" property=\"og:title\" content=\"Epic Film &#38; TV Soundtracks – A Candlelit Experience tickets - London | Fever\"><meta id=\"twitter:title\" property=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Epic Film &#38; TV Soundtracks – A Candlelit Experience tickets - London | Fever\"><meta id=\"og:description\" property=\"og:description\" content=\"Epic film &#38; TV soundtracks performed live in an intimate candlelit setting. Get your tickets now!\"><meta id=\"og:url\" property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://feverup.com/m/569419\"><meta id=\"og:image\" property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,ar_15:8,c_fill/fever2/plan/photo/8403930c-012b-11f1-ada3-e2293b0dfa43.jpeg\"><meta id=\"twitter:site\" property=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@feverapp\"><meta id=\"twitter:description\" property=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Epic film &#38; TV soundtracks performed live in an intimate candlelit setting. Get your tickets now!\"><!--[--><!--[--><!----><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"name\": \"Epic Film & TV Soundtracks - A Candlelit Experience\",\n  \"description\": \"🎵  This experience is brought to you by    CineDuo London   . This concert is not affiliated with the Fever Original Candlelight series.    General Info:   📅 Date:  14th March  ⏰ Time:  7:30 PM – 8:30 PM (doors open at 7 PM)  📍 Location:  St Saviour's Pimlico, St. Georges Square, London, SW1V 3QW  👤 Age requirement:  children under 14 must be accompanied by an adult and sit within the same band  🪑 Seating:  unallocated seating within seating bands (first come, first served)   This is NOT your usual candle concert...   One duo. One experience.  Yoon and Nurry are your international concert soloists for the evening. They&nbsp; are &nbsp;CineDuo – nobody else.  Show-Stopping Arrangements.  Every arrangement is written exclusively for CineDuo by award-winning arranger Stuart Bramwell&nbsp;– and performed by CineDuo alone.  Serious&nbsp;Virtuosity.  What Yoon and Nurry do best. Stuart's arrangements are&nbsp; REALLY&nbsp;challenging  – but with&nbsp;big risks&nbsp;come&nbsp; EPIC&nbsp; rewards.  Quality, not Quantity.﻿  Every month, between rehearsals and arranging, the group spend hundreds of hours preparing just a handful of bespoke concerts per year.   Programme  :   Movie Studio Intro Medley (3’)  Arr. Stuart Bramwell  Pirates of the Caribbean Medley (9’)  Arr. Stuart Bramwell Jack Sparrow, Davy Jones, The Medallion Calls, He’s a Pirate  Themes from The Lord of the Rings (12’)  Arr. Bill Galiiford  Avatar Medley (6’)  Arr. Stuart Bramwell Becoming one of “The People”, The bioluminescence of the night, Climbing up “Iknimaya – The Path to Heaven”, The destruction of Hometree  How to Train Your Dragon Medley (10’)  Arr. Stuart Bramwell This Is Berk, Romantic Flight, Forbidden Friendship, See You Tomorrow, Test Drive  Game of Thrones Medley (10’)  Arr. Stuart Bramwell The Rains of Castamere, The Winds of Winter, Light of the Seven, Opening Credits     \",\n  \"sku\": \"569419\",\n  \"@type\": \"Product\",\n  \"offers\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n      \"name\": \"Epic Film & TV Soundtracks - A Candlelit Experience - 7:30 pm Child under 14 £14.00\",\n      \"priceCurrency\": \"GBP\",\n      \"price\": 14,\n      \"areaServed\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Place\",\n        \"name\": \"St Saviour's Pimlico Church\",\n        \"address\": {\n          \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n          \"addressLocality\": \"London\"\n        },\n        \"geo\": {\n          \"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\",\n          \"latitude\": 51.48848779999999,\n          \"longitude\": -0.135236\n        }\n      },\n      \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n      \"url\": \"https://feverup.com/m/569419\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"image\": {\n    \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n    \"contentUrl\": \"https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,w_720,h_720/fever2/plan/photo/8403930c-012b-11f1-ada3-e2293b0dfa43.jpeg\",\n    \"contentLocation\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Place\",\n      \"geo\": {\n        \"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\",\n        \"latitude\": 51.48848779999999,\n        \"longitude\": -0.135236\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}</script><!----><!----><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"name\": \"Epic Film & TV Soundtracks - A Candlelit Experience\",\n  \"description\": \"🎵  This experience is brought to you by    CineDuo London   . This concert is not affiliated with the Fever Original Candlelight series.    General Info:   📅 Date:  14th March  ⏰ Time:  7:30 PM – 8:30 PM (doors open at 7 PM)  📍 Location:  St Saviour's Pimlico, St. Georges Square, London, SW1V 3QW  👤 Age requirement:  children under 14 must be accompanied by an adult and sit within the same band  🪑 Seating:  unallocated seating within seating bands (first come, first served)   This is NOT your usual candle concert...   One duo. One experience.  Yoon and Nurry are your international concert soloists for the evening. They&nbsp; are &nbsp;CineDuo – nobody else.  Show-Stopping Arrangements.  Every arrangement is written exclusively for CineDuo by award-winning arranger Stuart Bramwell&nbsp;– and performed by CineDuo alone.  Serious&nbsp;Virtuosity.  What Yoon and Nurry do best. Stuart's arrangements are&nbsp; REALLY&nbsp;challenging  – but with&nbsp;big risks&nbsp;come&nbsp; EPIC&nbsp; rewards.  Quality, not Quantity.﻿  Every month, between rehearsals and arranging, the group spend hundreds of hours preparing just a handful of bespoke concerts per year.   Programme  :   Movie Studio Intro Medley (3’)  Arr. Stuart Bramwell  Pirates of the Caribbean Medley (9’)  Arr. Stuart Bramwell Jack Sparrow, Davy Jones, The Medallion Calls, He’s a Pirate  Themes from The Lord of the Rings (12’)  Arr. Bill Galiiford  Avatar Medley (6’)  Arr. Stuart Bramwell Becoming one of “The People”, The bioluminescence of the night, Climbing up “Iknimaya – The Path to Heaven”, The destruction of Hometree  How to Train Your Dragon Medley (10’)  Arr. Stuart Bramwell This Is Berk, Romantic Flight, Forbidden Friendship, See You Tomorrow, Test Drive  Game of Thrones Medley (10’)  Arr. Stuart Bramwell The Rains of Castamere, The Winds of Winter, Light of the Seven, Opening Credits     \",\n  \"@type\": \"Event\",\n  \"startDate\": \"2026-03-14T19:30:00+00:00\",\n  \"endDate\": \"2026-03-14T19:30:00+00:00\",\n  \"url\": \"https://feverup.com/m/569419\",\n  \"image\": \"https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,w_720,h_720/fever2/plan/photo/8403930c-012b-11f1-ada3-e2293b0dfa43.jpeg\",\n  \"eventStatus\": \"EventScheduled\",\n  \"offers\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n      \"availabilityEnds\": \"2026-03-14T19:00:00+00:00\",\n      \"name\": \"Epic Film & TV Soundtracks - A Candlelit Experience - 7:30 pm Child under 14 £14.00\",\n      \"priceCurrency\": \"GBP\",\n      \"price\": 14,\n      \"validFrom\": \"2026-03-14T19:30:00+00:00\",\n      \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n      \"url\": \"https://feverup.com/m/569419\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"location\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Place\",\n    \"name\": \"St Saviour's Pimlico Church\",\n    \"address\": {\n      \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n      \"addressLocality\": \"London\"\n    },\n    \"geo\": {\n      \"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\",\n      \"latitude\": 51.48848779999999,\n      \"longitude\": -0.135236\n    }\n  }\n}</script><!----><!--]--><!--]--> <link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,w_320,h_320/fever2/plan/photo/8403930