6.4 0 190.4v-3.5C0 117.3 49.8 57.6 118.3 45.1c40.9-7.4 82.6 3.2 114.7 28.4c6.7 5.3 13 11.1 18.7 17.6l4.2 4.7 4.2-4.7c4.2-4.7 8.6-9.1 13.3-13.1c1.8-1.5 3.6-3 5.4-4.5z\" class=\"svelte-1ipid5s\"></path></svg><!----></button><!--]--><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> </div> <hr class=\"astro-eulym4nl\"> </div> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/PlanHeroInfo.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.CF3KGTfm.js\"></script>  </div>  <div id=\"plan-description\" class=\"plan-description astro-4r2zdndd\" data-testid=\"plan-content-description\">🎵 <em>This experience is brought to you by </em><strong><em>CineDuo London</em></strong><em>. This concert is not affiliated with the Fever Original Candlelight series.</em><br /><br /><strong>General Info:</strong><br /><strong>📅 Date: </strong>14th March<br /><strong>⏰ Time: </strong>7:30 PM – 8:30 PM (doors open at 7 PM)<br /><strong>📍 Location: </strong>St Saviour's Pimlico, St. Georges Square, London, SW1V 3QW<br /><strong>👤 Age requirement: </strong>children under 14 must be accompanied by an adult and sit within the same band<br /><strong>🪑 Seating: </strong>unallocated seating within seating bands (first come, first served)<br /><br /><strong>This is NOT your usual candle concert...</strong><br /><strong>One duo. One experience.</strong><br />Yoon and Nurry are your international concert soloists for the evening. They <em>are</em> CineDuo – nobody else.<br /><strong>Show-Stopping Arrangements.</strong><br />Every arrangement is written exclusively for CineDuo by award-winning arranger Stuart Bramwell – and performed by CineDuo alone.<br /><strong>Serious Virtuosity.</strong><br />What Yoon and Nurry do best. Stuart's arrangements are <strong>REALLY challenging </strong>– but with big risks come <strong>EPIC </strong>rewards.<br /><strong>Quality, not Quantity.﻿</strong><br />Every month, between rehearsals and arranging, the group spend hundreds of hours preparing just a handful of bespoke concerts per year.<br /><br /><strong>Programme</strong><em>:</em><br /><strong>Movie Studio Intro Medley (3’)</strong><br />Arr. Stuart Bramwell<br /><strong>Pirates of the Caribbean Medley (9’)</strong><br />Arr. Stuart Bramwell<br />Jack Sparrow, Davy Jones, The Medallion Calls, He’s a Pirate<br /><strong>Themes from The Lord of the Rings (12’)</strong><br />Arr. Bill Galiiford<br /><strong>Avatar Medley (6’)</strong><br />Arr. Stuart Bramwell<br />Becoming one of “The People”, The bioluminescence of the night,<br />Climbing up “Iknimaya – The Path to Heaven”, The destruction of Hometree<br /><strong>How to Train Your Dragon Medley (10’)</strong><br />Arr. Stuart Bramwell<br />This Is Berk, Romantic Flight, Forbidden Friendship,<br />See You Tomorrow, Test Drive<br /><strong>Game of Thrones Medley (10’)</strong><br />Arr. Stuart Bramwell<br />The Rains of Castamere, The Winds of Winter,<br />Light of the Seven, Opening Credits<br /><br /><br /><img src=\"https://images.feverup.com/plan/photo/06c4af00-02b3-11f1-ae5b-4657e336d5f3.jpeg\" /><br /></div> <astro-island uid=\"86Pj3\" component-url=\"/_astro/HTMLPlanDescriptionExperimentHandler.idEgzVjh.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.svelte.CPQfNHU-.js\" props=\"{&quot;planID&quot;:[0,569419],&quot;class&quot;:[0,&quot;astro-4r2zdndd&quot;]}\" ssr client=\"only\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;HTMLPlanDescriptionExperimentHandler&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;svelte&quot;}\"></astro-island> <astro-island uid=\"mcIqm\" component-url=\"/_astro/HTMLPlanDescriptionTabsHandler.mFbmXKWW.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.svelte.CPQfNHU-.js\" props=\"{&quot;class&quot;:[0,&quot;astro-4r2zdndd&quot;]}\" ssr client=\"only\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;HTMLPlanDescriptionTabsHandler&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;svelte&quot;}\"></astro-island>       <script>(()=>{var a=(s,i,o)=>{let r=async()=>{await(await s())()},t=typeof i.value==\"object\"?i.value:void 0,c={rootMargin:t==null?void 0:t.rootMargin}