{}},\"trackingData\":{\"field\":\"name\"},\"isVariant\":false,\"allowUnsafeHtml\":false},{\"value\":\"🎵 \\\\u003Cem\\\\u003EThis experience is brought to you by \\\\u003C/em\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cem\\\\u003EBelmont Ensemble\\\\u003C/em\\\\u003E\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cem\\\\u003E. This concert is not affiliated with the Fever Original Candlelight series.\\\\u003C/em\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cem\\\\u003ESeating is unreserved and allocated on arrival. Concession ticket holders may be seated in either the ground floor or balcony sections (but not Front Row).\\\\u0026nbsp;\\\\u003C/em\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003EHighlights\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 🌙 London\\\\u0027s finest musicians perform Gershwin\\\\u0027s Rhapsody in Blue and other classical favourites\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 🏛️ The perfect option for first-time classical concert-goers\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E ⛪ The beautiful Bloomsbury Central gently lit by candlelight\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003EGeneral Info\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 📅 Dates and times: select your date and time directly in the ticket selector\\\\u0026nbsp;\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E ⏳ Duration: 1 hour. Doors open 30 minutes before the concert starts\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 📍 Location: Bloomsbury Central, 235 Shaftesbury Avenue, London\\\\u0026nbsp;\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 👤 Age requirement: 6+\\\\u0026nbsp;(Concession children tickets are available for under 18 years old.)\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cu\\\\u003EProgramme :\\\\u003C/u\\\\u003E\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cul\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cli\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003E6 June at 5pm and 7:30pm\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003C/li\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cli\\\\u003EBeethoven - \\\\u0027Moonlight\\\\u0027 Sonata\\\\u003C/li\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cli\\\\u003EGershwin - Rhapsody in Blue\\\\u003C/li\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cli\\\\u003EMozart - Rondo in A Minor\\\\u003C/li\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cli\\\\u003EChopin - Barcarolle in F Sharp Major\\\\u003C/li\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cli\\\\u003ERachmaninov - Preludes in D Major and G Minor\\\\u003C/li\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cli\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cem\\\\u003ECostas Fotopoulos - Piano\\\\u003C/em\\\\u003E\\\\u003C/li\\\\u003E\\\\u003C/ul\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cul\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cli\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003E4 July at 5pm and 7:30pm\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003C/li\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cli\\\\u003EGershwin - Rhapsody in Blue\\\\u003C/li\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cli\\\\u003EBeethoven - \\\\u0027Moonlight\\\\u0027 Sonata\\\\u003C/li\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cli\\\\u003EMozart - Piano Sonata in C Major K.545\\\\u003C/li\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cli\\\\u003ERavel - Ondine from Gaspard de la nuit\\\\u003C/li\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cli\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cem\\\\u003EViktor Erik Emanuel - Piano\\\\u003C/em\\\\u003E\\\\u003C/li\\\\u003E\\\\u003C/ul\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003EDescription\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003EBrought to you by \\\\u003Cem\\\\u003EBelmont Ensemble\\\\u003C/em\\\\u003E, immerse yourself in the enchanting world of classical music at London\\\\u0027s Bloomsbury Central Baptist Church, gently lit by candlelight. Perfect for first-time classical concert-goers, this unforgettable evening features London\\\\u0027s finest musicians performing Gershwin\\\\u0027s dynamic \\\\u0027Rhapsody in Blue\\\\u0027 and other timeless favourites. From Gershwin\\\\u0027s dazzling \\\\u0027Rhapsody in Blue\\\\u0027 to Beethoven\\\\u0027s \\\\u0027Moonlight\\\\u0027 Sonata, from Mozart\\\\u0027s haunting Rondo to Chopin\\\\u0027s exquisite Nocturnes, let the music transport you to a realm of pure elegance and beauty. Get your tickets now for \\\\u003Cem\\\\u003ERhapsody in Blue by Candlelight on Shaftesbury Avenue\\\\u003C/em\\\\u003E, in the heart of London\\\\u0027s famous Theatre District!\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\",\"storedData\":{