6.6-103.8 35.8l-4.2 4.7-12 13.5c-3 3.4-7.4 5.4-12 5.4s-8.9-2-12-5.4zm34.9-57.1C311 48.4 352.7 37.7 393.7 45.1C462.2 57.6 512 117.3 512 186.9v3.5c0 36-13.1 70.6-36.6 97.5c-3.4 3.8-6.9 7.5-10.7 11l-184 171.3c-.8 .8-1.7 1.5-2.6 2.2c-6.3 4.9-14.1 7.5-22.1 7.5c-9.2 0-18-3.5-24.8-9.7L47.2 299c-3.8-3.5-7.3-7.2-10.7-11C13.1 261 0 226.4 0 190.4v-3.5C0 117.3 49.8 57.6 118.3 45.1c40.9-7.4 82.6 3.2 114.7 28.4c6.7 5.3 13 11.1 18.7 17.6l4.2 4.7 4.2-4.7c4.2-4.7 8.6-9.1 13.3-13.1c1.8-1.5 3.6-3 5.4-4.5z\" class=\"svelte-1ipid5s\"></path></svg><!----></button><!--]--><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> </div> <hr class=\"astro-eulym4nl\"> </div> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/PlanHeroInfo.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.CF3KGTfm.js\"></script>  </div>  <div id=\"plan-description\" class=\"plan-description astro-4r2zdndd\" data-testid=\"plan-content-description\">🎵 <em>This experience is brought to you by </em><strong><em>Belmont Ensemble</em></strong><em>. This concert is not affiliated with the Fever Original Candlelight series.</em><br /><em>Seating is unreserved and allocated on arrival. Concession ticket holders may be seated in either the ground floor or balcony sections (but not Front Row). </em><br /><br /><strong>Highlights</strong><br /> 🌙 London's finest musicians perform Gershwin's Rhapsody in Blue and other classical favourites<br /> 🏛️ The perfect option for first-time classical concert-goers<br /> ⛪ The beautiful Bloomsbury Central gently lit by candlelight<br /><br /><strong>General Info</strong><br /> 📅 Dates and times: select your date and time directly in the ticket selector <br /> ⏳ Duration: 1 hour. Doors open 30 minutes before the concert starts<br /> 📍 Location: Bloomsbury Central, 235 Shaftesbury Avenue, London <br /> 👤 Age requirement: 6+ (Concession children tickets are available for under 18 years old.)<br /><br /><strong><u>Programme :</u></strong><br /><br /><ul><li><strong>6 June at 5pm and 7:30pm</strong></li><li>Beethoven - 'Moonlight' Sonata</li><li>Gershwin - Rhapsody in Blue</li><li>Mozart - Rondo in A Minor</li><li>Chopin - Barcarolle in F Sharp Major</li><li>Rachmaninov - Preludes in D Major and G Minor</li><li><em>Costas Fotopoulos - Piano</em></li></ul><br /><ul><li><strong>4 July at 5pm and 7:30pm</strong></li><li>Gershwin - Rhapsody in Blue</li><li>Beethoven - 'Moonlight' Sonata</li><li>Mozart - Piano Sonata in C Major K.545</li><li>Ravel - Ondine from Gaspard de la nuit</li><li><em>Viktor Erik Emanuel - Piano</em></li></ul><br /><strong>Description</strong><br />Brought to you by <em>Belmont Ensemble</em>, immerse yourself in the enchanting world of classical music at London's Bloomsbury Central Baptist Church, gently lit by candlelight. Perfect for first-time classical concert-goers, this unforgettable evening features London's finest musicians performing Gershwin's dynamic 'Rhapsody in Blue' and other timeless favourites. From Gershwin's dazzling 'Rhapsody in Blue' to Beethoven's 'Moonlight' Sonata, from Mozart's haunting Rondo to Chopin's exquisite Nocturnes, let the music transport you to a realm of pure elegance and beauty. Get your tickets now for <em>Rhapsody in Blue by Candlelight on Shaftesbury Avenue</em>, in the heart of London's famous Theatre District!<br /></div> <astro-island uid=\"2mSHbv\" component-url=\"/_astro/HTMLPlanDescriptionExperimentHandler.idEgzVjh.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.svelte.CPQfNHU-.js\" props=\"{&quot;planID&quot;:[0,178893],&quot;class&quot;:[0,&quot;astro-4r2zdndd&quot;]}\" ssr client=\"only\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;HTMLPlanDescriptionExperimentHandler&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;svelte&quot;}\"></astro-island> <astro-island uid=\"mcIqm\" component-url=\"/_astro/HTMLPlanDescriptionTabsHandler.mFbmXKWW.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.svelte.CPQfNHU-.js\" props=\"{&quot;class&quot;:[0,&quot;astro-4r2zdndd&quot;]}\" ssr client=\"only\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;HTMLPlanDescriptionTabsHandler&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;svelte&quot;}\"></astro-island>       <script>(()=>{var a=(s,i,o)=>{let r=async()=>{await(await s())()},t=typeof i.value==\"object\"?i.value:void 0,c={rootMargin:t==null?void 0:t.rootMargin},n=new IntersectionObserver(e=>{for(let l of e)if(l.isIntersecting){n.disconnect(),r();break}},c);for(let e of o.children)n.observe(e)};(self.Astro||(self.Astro={})).visible=a;window.dispatchEvent(new Event(\"astro:visible\"));})();</script><!--[--><section class=\"plan-content__block svelte-vu3cyy\" data-testid=\"plan-content-help\"><!----> <!--[--><h2 class=\"plan-content__block-title svelte-cwjbxa\"><!----> <!--[--><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-user-headset svelte-1ipid5s\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M224 32C135.6 32 64 103.6 64 192v16c0 8.8-7.2 16-16 16s-16-7.2-16-16V192C32 86 118 0 224 0S416 86 416 192v16c0 61.9-50.1 112-112 112H240 224 208c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32s14.3-32 32-32h32c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32h32c44.2 0 80-35.8 80-80V192c0-88.4-71.6-160-160-160zm0 32c70.7 0 128 57.3 128 128c0 13.9-2.2 27.3-6.3 39.8C337.4 246.3 321.8 256 304 256h-8.4c15.2-17 24.4-39.4 24.4-64c0-53-43-96-96-96s-96 43-96 96c0 24.6 9.3 47.1 24.5 64.1c-5.4 9.4-8.5 20.3-8.5 31.9c0 1.4 0 2.7 .1 4C114.8 268.6 96 232.5 96 192c0-70.7 57.3-128 128-128zM208 352h16 16 64 9.6C387.8 352 448 412.2 448 486.4c0 14.1-11.5 25.6-25.6 25.6H25.6C11.5 512 0 500.5 0 486.4C0 412.2 60.2 352 134.4 352H208zm105.6 32H134.4C80 384 35.5 426.4 32.2 480H415.8c-3.3-53.6-47.8-96-102.2-96z\" class=\"svelte-1ipid5s\"></path></svg><!--]--> Need help?<!----></h2><!--]--> Contact Support&nbsp;<astro-island uid=\"JlRk\" component-url=\"/_astro/PlanHelpLink.-2XcG6aY.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.svelte.CPQfNHU-.js\" props=\"{&quot;planId&quot;:[0,178893],&quot;planName&quot;:[0,&quot;Rhapsody in Blue and Moonlight Sonata by candlelight&quot;],&