d5s\"></path></svg><!----></button><!--]--><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> </div> <hr class=\"astro-eulym4nl\"> </div> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/PlanHeroInfo.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.CF3KGTfm.js\"></script>  </div>  <div id=\"plan-description\" class=\"plan-description astro-4r2zdndd\" data-testid=\"plan-content-description\">🎵 <em>This experience is brought to you by </em><strong><em>CineDuo London</em></strong><em>. This concert is not affiliated with the Fever Original Candlelight series.</em><br /><br /><strong>General Info:</strong><br /><strong>📅 Date: </strong>13th March<br /><strong>⏰ Time: </strong>6:30 PM – 7:30 PM / 8:30 PM - 9:30 PM (Doors open 30 minutes prior)<br /><strong>📍 Location: </strong>Windsor Parish Church of St John The Baptist, High St, Windsor SL4 1LS<br /><strong>👤 Age requirement: </strong>children under 14 must be accompanied by an adult and sit within the same band<br /><strong>🪑 Seating: </strong>unallocated seating within seating bands (first come, first served)<br /><br /><strong>This is NOT your usual candle concert...</strong><br /><strong>One duo. One experience.</strong><br />Yoon and Nurry are your international concert soloists for the evening. They <em>are</em> CineDuo – nobody else.<br /><strong>Show-Stopping Arrangements.</strong><br />Every arrangement is written exclusively for CineDuo by award-winning arranger Stuart Bramwell – and performed by CineDuo alone.<br /><strong>Serious Virtuosity.</strong><br />What Yoon and Nurry do best. Stuart's arrangements are<strong> REALLY challenging </strong>– but with big risks come <strong>EPIC </strong>rewards.<br /><strong>Quality, not Quantity.﻿</strong><br />Every month, between rehearsals and arranging, the group spend hundreds of hours preparing just a handful of bespoke concerts per year.<br /><br /><strong>Programme</strong><em>:</em><br /><strong>Movie Studio Intro Medley (3’)</strong><br />Arr. Stuart Bramwell<br /><strong>Pirates of the Caribbean Medley (9’)</strong><br />Arr. Stuart Bramwell<br />Jack Sparrow, Davy Jones, The Medallion Calls, He’s a Pirate<br /><strong>Themes from The Lord of the Rings (12’)</strong><br />Arr. Bill Galiiford<br /><strong>Avatar Medley (6’)</strong><br />Arr. Stuart Bramwell<br />Becoming one of “The People”, The bioluminescence of the night,<br />Climbing up “Iknimaya – The Path to Heaven”, The destruction of Hometree<br /><strong>How to Train Your Dragon Medley (10’)</strong><br />Arr. Stuart Bramwell<br />This Is Berk, Romantic Flight, Forbidden Friendship,<br />See You Tomorrow, Test Drive<br /><strong>Game of Thrones Medley (10’)</strong><br />Arr. Stuart Bramwell<br />The Rains of Castamere, The Winds of Winter,<br />Light of the Seven, Opening Credits<br /><br /><br /><img src=\"https://images.feverup.com/plan/photo/c2b2c50c-073c-11f1-925c-1af316423b5e.jpeg\" /><br /></div> <astro-island uid=\"Z1Pu2j\" component-url=\"/_astro/HTMLPlanDescriptionExperimentHandler.idEgzVjh.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.svelte.CPQfNHU-.js\" props=\"{&quot;planID&quot;:[0,572604],&quot;class&quot;:[0,&quot;astro-4r2zdndd&quot;]}\" ssr client=\"only\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;HTMLPlanDescriptionExperimentHandler&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;svelte&quot;}\"></astro-island> <astro-island uid=\"mcIqm\" component-url=\"/_astro/HTMLPlanDescriptionTabsHandler.mFbmXKWW.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.svelte.CPQfNHU-.js\" props=\"{&quot;class&quot;:[0,&quot;astro-4r2zdndd&quot;]}\" ssr client=\"only\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;HTMLPlanDescriptionTabsHandler&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;svelte&quot;}\"></astro-island>       <script>(()=>{var a=(s,i,o)=>{let r=async()=>{await(await s())()},t=typeof i.value==\"object\"?i.value:void 0,c={rootMargin:t==null?void 0:t.rootMargin},n=new IntersectionObserver(e=>{for(let l of e)if(l.isIntersecting){n.disconnect(),r();break}},c);for(let e of o.children)n.observe(e)};(self.Astro||(self.Astro={})).visible=a;window.dispatchEvent(new Event(\"astro:visible\"));})();</script><!--[--><section class=\"plan-content__block svelte-vu3cyy\" data-testid=\"plan-content-help\"><!----> <!--[--><h2 class=\"plan-content__block-title svelte-cwjbxa\"><!----> <!--[--><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-user-headset svelte-1ipid5s\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M224 32C135.6 32 64 103.6 64 192v16c0 8.8-7.2 16-16 16s-16-7.2-16-16V192C32 86 118 0 224 0S416 86 416 192v16c0 61.9-50.1 112-112 112H240 224 208c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32s14.3-32 32-32h32c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32h32c44.2 0 80-35.8 80-80V192c0-88.4-71.6-160-160-160zm0 32c70.7 0 128 57.3 128 128c0 13.9-2.2 27.3-6.3 39.8C337.4 246.3 321.8 256 304 256h-8.4c15.2-17 24.4-39.4 24.4-64c0-53-43-96-96-96s-96 43-96 96c0 24.6 9.3 47.1 24.5 64.1c-5.4 9.4-8.5 20.3-8.5 31.9c0 1.4 0 2.7 .1 4C114.8 268.6 96 232.5 96 192c0-70.7 57.3-128 128-128zM208 352h16 16 64 9.6C387.8 352 448 412.2 448 486.4c0 14.1-11.5 25.6-25.6 25.6H25.6C11.5 512 0 500.5 0 486.4C0 412.2 60.2 352 134.4 352H208zm105.6 32H134.4C80 384 35.5 426.4 32.2 480H415.8c-3.3-53.6-47.8-96-102.2-96z\" class=\"svelte-1ipid5s\"></path></svg><!--]--> Need help?<!----></h2><!--]--> Contact Support&nbsp;<astro-island uid=\"Z91eef\" component-url=\"/_astro/PlanHelpLink.-2XcG6aY.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.svelte.CPQfNHU-.js\" props=\"{&quot;planId&quot;:[0,572604],&quot;planName&quot;:[0,&quot;Epic Film &amp; TV Soundtracks - A Candlelit Experience&quot;],&quot;cityCode&quot;:[0,&quot;LON&quot;],&quot;country&quot;:[0,&quot;UK&quot;],&quot;faqUrl&quot;:[0,&quot;https://fever.zendesk.com/hc/en-us&quot;]}\" ssr client=\"visible\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;PlanHelpLink&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}\" await-children><!--[--><a href=\"https://fever.zendesk.com/hc/en-us?ticket_form_id=360001032452&amp;plan_id=572604&amp;plan_name