            "mimeType": "text/html",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"astro-sckkx6r4\"> <head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"> <title>Taste Film presents Bridesmaids (2011) - Tickets | Fever</title><meta id=\"description\" name=\"description\" content=\"Whilst you watch the film, we’ll be dishing up parisian popcorn, engagement party canapes (it’s a steak bernaise don’t ya know), DIY cupcakes, crash-out fondue and yep, we’re giving you the kebab scene. Get your tickets now!\"><link id=\"canonical\" rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/562301\"><link id=\"alternate:en\" rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/562301\" hreflang=\"x-default\"><link id=\"alternate:en\" rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/562301\" hreflang=\"en\"><link id=\"alternate:es\" rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/562301/es\" hreflang=\"es\"><meta id=\"robots\" name=\"robots\" content=\"index\"><meta name=\"google\" content=\"notranslate\"><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"><meta name=\"mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\"><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\"><meta id=\"al:ios:url\" property=\"al:ios:url\" content=\"fb212044188860269://m/562301\"><meta id=\"al:android:url\" property=\"al:android:url\" content=\"fb212044188860269://m/562301\"><meta id=\"al:android:package\" property=\"al:android:package\" content=\"com.feverup.fever\"><link id=\"apple-touch-icon\" rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"/favicons/apple-touch-icon.png\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"48x48\" href=\"/favicons/favicon-48x48.png\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"/favicons/favicon-32x32.png\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"16x16\" href=\"/favicons/favicon-16x16.png\"><link rel=\"mask-icon\" href=\"/favicons/favicon-safari-pinned-tab.svg\" color=\"#10212e\"><link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/favicons/shortcut-favicon.ico\"><meta name=\"msapplication-config\" content=\"/browserconfig.xml\"><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://applications-media.feverup.com\"><meta name=\"msapplication-TileColor\" content=\"#10212e\"><meta name=\"msapplication-config\" content=\"/browserconfig.xml\"><meta property=\"fb:app_id\" content=\"212044188860269\"><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Fever\"><meta id=\"og:type\" property=\"og:type\" content=\"product\"><meta id=\"og:title\" property=\"og:title\" content=\"Taste Film presents Bridesmaids (2011) - Tickets | Fever\"><meta id=\"twitter:title\" property=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Taste Film presents Bridesmaids (2011) - Tickets | Fever\"><meta id=\"og:description\" property=\"og:description\" content=\"Whilst you watch the film, we’ll be dishing up parisian popcorn, engagement party canapes (it’s a steak bernaise don’t ya know), DIY cupcakes, crash-out fondue and yep, we’re giving you the kebab scene. Get your tickets now!\"><meta id=\"og:url\" property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://feverup.com/m/562301\"><meta id=\"og:image\" property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,ar_15:8,c_fill/fever2/plan/photo/b1d491f4-fac9-11f0-bf29-c6b2232abd39.jpg\"><meta id=\"twitter:site\" property=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@feverapp\"><meta id=\"twitter:description\" property=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Whilst you watch the film, we’ll be dishing up parisian popcorn, engagement party canapes (it’s a steak bernaise don’t ya know), DIY cupcakes, crash-out fondue and yep, we’re giving you the kebab scen\"><!--[--><!--[--><!----><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"name\": \"Taste Film presents Bridesmaids (2011)\",\n  \"description\": \"⭐  Taste Film believes films should be more than just watched - they should be lived, shared, and tasted. Get ready to embark on a journey where fine food and iconic film moments collide, transforming your night out into an unforgettable adventure.    Highlights   🎥 Don’t just watch the film… savour it!  👰 Enjoy a multi-course menu inspired by the film Bridesmaids (2011)  🍴 Dine in sync with iconic on-screen moments   General Info   📅 Date: May 2026  🕐 Time: Please check your booking for specific event times.  📍 Location: The Refinery Citypoint, EC2Y 9HT  👤 Age rating: this film is rated  15  (minimum age 15)  ♿ Accessibility: This venue is wheelchair accessible  🍽️ The menu: to view the menu, please click  here   ❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience  here    Description   SAVE THE DATE!   The real stars of a wedding are the bridesmaids, and these girls are about to take it to a whole new level. From bridal shower chaos, dog-napping and Wilson Phillips, relive every laugh-out-loud, quotable moment while indulging in our elevated menu. Perfect for friends, hens and well, anyone who loves dirty comedy and delicious food. It’s the ultimate girls’ night: cute, joyful, and unforgettable.   Whilst you watch the film, we’ll be dishing up parisian popcorn, engagement party canapes (it’s a steak bernaise don’t ya know), DIY cupcakes, crash-out fondue and yep, we’re giving you the kebab scene. We know how to start a party.   Here comes the bride(smaids)! \",\n  \"sku\": \"562301\",\n  \"@type\": \"Product\",\n  \"offers\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n      \"name\": \"Taste Film presents Bridesmaids (2011) - Classic with cocktail\",\n      \"priceCurrency\": \"GBP\",\n      \"price\": 85.8,\n      \"areaServed\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Place\",\n        \"name\": \"The Refinery Citypoint\",\n        \"address\": {\n          \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n          \"addressLocality\": \"London\"\n        },\n        \"geo\": {\n          \"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\",\n          \"latitude\": 51.5190369,\n          \"longitude\": -0.09013779999999998\n        }\n      },\n      \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n      \"url\": \"https://feverup.com/m/562301\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"image\": {\n    \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n    \"contentUrl\": \"https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,w_720,h_720/fever2/plan/photo/b1d491f4-fac9-11f0-bf29-c6b2232abd39.jpg\",\n    \"contentLocation\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Place\",\n      \"geo\": {\n        \"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\",\n        \"latitude\": 51.5190369,\n        \"longitude\": -0.09013779999999998\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}</script><!----><!--]--><!--]--> <link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,w_320,h_320/fever2/plan/photo/b1d491f4-fac9-11f0-bf29-c6b2232abd39.jpg\" imagesrcset=\"https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,w_320,h_320/fever2/plan/photo/b1d491f4-fac9-11f0-bf29-c6b2232abd39.jpg 320w, https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,w_550,h_550/fever2/plan/photo/b1d491f4-fac9-11f0-bf29-c6b2232abd39.jpg 550w\" imagesizes=\"(max-width: 999px) 550px, 315px\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"> <link rel=\"preload\" as=\"font\" href=\"/_astro/fonts/montserrat_v25_JTUSjIg1_i6t8kCHKm459WlhyyTh89Y.woff2\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"><style>@keyframes skeleton-loading{0%{background-position:200%}to{background-position:-200%}}.fv-loader:where(.astro-qr7epx6e){display:none;justify-content:center;align-items:center;top:0;left:0;width:100lvw;height:100lvh;z-index:9999}.fv-loader:where(.astro-qr7epx6e).active{position:fixed;display:flex}.fv-loader:where(.astro-qr7epx6e) svg:where(.astro-qr7epx6e){width:6.25rem}.fv-loader--scheme-dark:where(.astro-qr7epx6e){background-color:#06232c}.fv-loader--scheme-dark:where(.astro-qr7epx6e) svg:where(.astro-qr7epx6e){color:#fff}.fv-loader--scheme-light:where(.astro-qr7epx6e){background-color:#fff}.fv-loader--scheme-light:where(.astro-qr7epx6e) svg:where(.astro-qr7epx6e){color:#06232c}@keyframes svelte-1is6vbr-skeleton-loading{0%{background-position:200%}to{background-position:-200%}}.fv-reviews-share-button.svelte-1is6vbr{background-c