ns\":\"true\"}},\"experimentation\":{\"optimizely\":{\"key\":\"DqiQArRZFijaai4G8NfQ1K\"}},\"google\":{\"storeUrl\":\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.feverup.fever\",\"place\":{\"key\":\"AIzaSyAzz5QA02Lmzl-3YQvjiSvOQmsUKLvuSw4\"},\"maps\":{\"key\":\"AIzaSyDMs02xUjIR6VWW_5Z8XAuLOmRX7HxvlLI\"}},\"queue\":{\"queueIt\":{\"account\":\"feverup\"},\"queuedPlans\":\"\",\"comingSoonPlans\":\"\"},\"fraudDetection\":{\"riskified\":{\"shopDomain\":\"feverup.com\"},\"forter\":{\"siteId\":\"039249618c32\"}}},\"plan-ab-tests\":[{\"value\":\"Taste Film presents Bridesmaids (2011)\",\"storedData\":{\"key\":\"fv_plan_name_ab_test\",\"value\":{}},\"trackingData\":{\"field\":\"name\"},\"isVariant\":false,\"allowUnsafeHtml\":false},{\"value\":\"⭐ \\\\u003Cem\\\\u003ETaste Film believes films should be more than just watched - they should be lived, shared, and tasted. Get ready to embark on a journey where fine food and iconic film moments collide, transforming your night out into an unforgettable adventure.\\\\u003C/em\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003EHighlights\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 🎥 Don’t just watch the film… savour it!\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 👰 Enjoy a multi-course menu inspired by the film Bridesmaids (2011)\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 🍴 Dine in sync with iconic on-screen moments\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003EGeneral Info\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 📅 Date: May 2026\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 🕐 Time: Please check your booking for specific event times.\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 📍 Location: The Refinery Citypoint, EC2Y 9HT\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 👤 Age rating: this film is rated \\\\u003Ca href=\\\\u0022https://www.bbfc.co.uk/release/bridesmaids-q29sbgvjdglvbjpwwc0xmda3mdy4\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener noreferrer\\\\u0022\\\\u003E15\\\\u003C/a\\\\u003E (minimum age 15)\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E ♿ Accessibility: This venue is wheelchair accessible\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 🍽️ The menu: to view the menu, please click \\\\u003Ca href=\\\\u0022https://drive.google.com/file/d/1p8lJbDZSgiyUi-KoIZckGDykunrbyDnz/view?usp=drive_link\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener noreferrer\\\\u0022\\\\u003Ehere\\\\u003C/a\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E ❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience \\\\u003Ca href=\\\\u0022https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSp2K6XG_QIZ2Gg_zrZb2xW9_xXjZJUPTPFAstXgmSUJavlcRlINfSLSKiSYT1VBfylMThAsmy0Fqjs/pub\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener noreferrer\\\\u0022\\\\u003Ehere\\\\u003C/a\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003EDescription\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E SAVE THE DATE!\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E The real stars of a wedding are the bridesmaids, and these girls are about to take it to a whole new level. From bridal shower chaos, dog-napping and Wilson Phillips, relive every laugh-out-loud, quotable moment while indulging in our elevated menu. Perfect for friends, hens and well, anyone who loves dirty comedy and delicious food. It’s the ultimate girls’ night: cute, joyful, and unforgettable.\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E Whilst you watch the film, we’ll be dishing up parisian popcorn, engagement party canapes (it’s a steak bernaise don’t ya know), DIY cupcakes, crash-out fondue and yep, we’re giving you the kebab scene. We know how to start a party.\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E Here comes the bride(smaids)!\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\",\"storedData\":{\"key\":\"fv_plan_description_ab_test\",\"value\":{}},\"trackingData\":{\"field\":\"description\"},\"isVariant\":false,\"allowUnsafeHtml\":false},{\"value\":\"https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,w_720,h_720/fever2/plan/photo/b1d491f4-fac9-11f0-bf29-c6b2232abd39.jpg\",\"storedData\":{\"key\":\"fv_plan_cover_image_ab_test\",\"value\":{}},\"trackingData\":{\"field\":\"cover_image\"},\"isVariant\":false,\"allowUnsafeHtml\":false}],\"page-config\":{\"name\":\"plan\",\"planDetail\":{\"aBTesting\":null,\