/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 📅 Date: May 2026\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 🕐 Time: Please check your booking for specific event times.\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 📍 Location: The Refinery Citypoint, EC2Y 9HT\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 👤 Age rating: this film is rated \\\\u003Ca href=\\\\u0022https://www.bbfc.co.uk/release/bridesmaids-q29sbgvjdglvbjpwwc0xmda3mdy4\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener noreferrer\\\\u0022\\\\u003E15\\\\u003C/a\\\\u003E (minimum age 15)\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E ♿ Accessibility: This venue is wheelchair accessible\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 🍽️ The menu: to view the menu, please click \\\\u003Ca href=\\\\u0022https://drive.google.com/file/d/1p8lJbDZSgiyUi-KoIZckGDykunrbyDnz/view?usp=drive_link\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener noreferrer\\\\u0022\\\\u003Ehere\\\\u003C/a\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E ❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience \\\\u003Ca href=\\\\u0022https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSp2K6XG_QIZ2Gg_zrZb2xW9_xXjZJUPTPFAstXgmSUJavlcRlINfSLSKiSYT1VBfylMThAsmy0Fqjs/pub\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener noreferrer\\\\u0022\\\\u003Ehere\\\\u003C/a\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003EDescription\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E SAVE THE DATE!\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E The real stars of a wedding are the bridesmaids, and these girls are about to take it to a whole new level. From bridal shower chaos, dog-napping and Wilson Phillips, relive every laugh-out-loud, quotable moment while indulging in our elevated menu. Perfect for friends, hens and well, anyone who loves dirty comedy and delicious food. It’s the ultimate girls’ night: cute, joyful, and unforgettable.\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E Whilst you watch the film, we’ll be dishing up parisian popcorn, engagement party canapes (it’s a steak bernaise don’t ya know), DIY cupcakes, crash-out fondue and yep, we’re giving you the kebab scene. We know how to start a party.\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E Here comes the bride(smaids)!