-3 5.4-4.5z\" class=\"svelte-1ipid5s\"></path></svg><!----></button><!--]--><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> </div> <hr class=\"astro-eulym4nl\"> </div> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/PlanHeroInfo.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.CF3KGTfm.js\"></script>  </div>  <div id=\"plan-description\" class=\"plan-description astro-4r2zdndd\" data-testid=\"plan-content-description\">⭐ <em>Taste Film believes films should be more than just watched - they should be lived, shared, and tasted. Get ready to embark on a journey where fine food and iconic film moments collide, transforming your night out into an unforgettable adventure.</em><br /><br /><strong>Highlights</strong><br /> 🎥 Don’t just watch the film… savour it!<br /> 👰 Enjoy a multi-course menu inspired by the film Bridesmaids (2011)<br /> 🍴 Dine in sync with iconic on-screen moments<br /><br /><strong>General Info</strong><br /> 📅 Date: May 2026<br /> 🕐 Time: Please check your booking for specific event times.<br /> 📍 Location: The Refinery Citypoint, EC2Y 9HT<br /> 👤 Age rating: this film is rated <a href=\"https://www.bbfc.co.uk/release/bridesmaids-q29sbgvjdglvbjpwwc0xmda3mdy4\">15</a> (minimum age 15)<br /> ♿ Accessibility: This venue is wheelchair accessible<br /> 🍽️ The menu: to view the menu, please click <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1p8lJbDZSgiyUi-KoIZckGDykunrbyDnz/view?usp=drive_link\">here</a><br /> ❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSp2K6XG_QIZ2Gg_zrZb2xW9_xXjZJUPTPFAstXgmSUJavlcRlINfSLSKiSYT1VBfylMThAsmy0Fqjs/pub\">here</a><br /><br /><strong>Description</strong><br /> SAVE THE DATE!<br /><br /> The real stars of a wedding are the bridesmaids, and these girls are about to take it to a whole new level. From bridal shower chaos, dog-napping and Wilson Phillips, relive every laugh-out-loud, quotable moment while indulging in our elevated menu. Perfect for friends, hens and well, anyone who loves dirty comedy and delicious food. It’s the ultimate girls’ night: cute, joyful, and unforgettable.<br /><br /> Whilst you watch the film, we’ll be dishing up parisian popcorn, engagement party canapes (it’s a steak bernaise don’t ya know), DIY cupcakes, crash-out fondue and yep, we’re giving you the kebab scene. We know how to start a party.<br /><br /> Here comes the bride(smaids)!<br /></div> <astro-island uid=\"19CJ0z\" component-url=\"/_astro/HTMLPlanDescriptionExperimentHandler.idEgzVjh.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.svelte.CPQfNHU-.js\" props=\"{&quot;planID&quot;:[0,562301],&quot;class&quot;:[0,&quot;astro-4r2zdndd&quot;]}\" ssr client=\"only\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;HTMLPlanDescriptionExperimentHandler&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;svelte&quot;}\"></astro-island> <astro-island uid=\"mcIqm\" component-url=\"/_astro/HTMLPlanDescriptionTabsHandler.mFbmXKWW.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.svelte.CPQfNHU-.js\" props=\"{&quot;class&quot;:[0,&quot;astro-4r2zdndd&quot;]}\" ssr client=\"only\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;HTMLPlanDescriptionTabsHandler&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;svelte&quot;}\"></astro-island> <astro-island uid=\"1z7CYS\" component-url=\"/_astro/HTMLPlanDescriptionLinkTracking.WlW-Qa2O.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.svelte.CPQfNHU-.js\" props=\"{&quot;trackableURLs&quot;:[1,[[0,&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSp2K6XG_QIZ2Gg_zrZb2xW9_xXjZJUPTPFAstXgmSUJavlcRlINfSLSKiSYT1VBfylMThAsmy0Fqjs/pub&quot;]]],&quot;planID&quot;:[0,562301],&quot;class&quot;:[0,&quot;astro-4r2zdndd&quot;]}\" ssr client=\"only\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;HTMLPlanDescriptionLinkTracking&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;svelte&quot;}\"></astro-island>      <script>(()=>{var a=(s,i,o)=>{let r=async()=>{await(await s())()},t=typeof i.value==\"object\"?i.value:void 0,c={rootMargin:t==null?void 0:t.rootMargin},n=new IntersectionObserver(e=>{for(let l of e)if(l.isIntersecting){n