            "mimeType": "text/html",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"astro-sckkx6r4\"> <head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"> <title>Taste Film presents Guardians of The Galaxy (2014) - Tickets | Fever</title><meta id=\"description\" name=\"description\" content=\"As the film plays out on screen, you’ll be served a bespoke, cinematic tasting menu inspired by our favourite moments from the film. Get your tickets now!\"><link id=\"canonical\" rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/562307\"><link id=\"alternate:en\" rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/562307\" hreflang=\"x-default\"><link id=\"alternate:en\" rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/562307\" hreflang=\"en\"><link id=\"alternate:es\" rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/562307/es\" hreflang=\"es\"><meta id=\"robots\" name=\"robots\" content=\"index\"><meta name=\"google\" content=\"notranslate\"><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"><meta name=\"mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\"><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\"><meta id=\"al:ios:url\" property=\"al:ios:url\" content=\"fb212044188860269://m/562307\"><meta id=\"al:android:url\" property=\"al:android:url\" content=\"fb212044188860269://m/562307\"><meta id=\"al:android:package\" property=\"al:android:package\" content=\"com.feverup.fever\"><link id=\"apple-touch-icon\" rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"/favicons/apple-touch-icon.png\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"48x48\" href=\"/favicons/favicon-48x48.png\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"/favicons/favicon-32x32.png\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"16x16\" href=\"/favicons/favicon-16x16.png\"><link rel=\"mask-icon\" href=\"/favicons/favicon-safari-pinned-tab.svg\" color=\"#10212e\"><link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/favicons/shortcut-favicon.ico\"><meta name=\"msapplication-config\" content=\"/browserconfig.xml\"><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://applications-media.feverup.com\"><meta name=\"msapplication-TileColor\" content=\"#10212e\"><meta name=\"msapplication-config\" content=\"/browserconfig.xml\"><meta property=\"fb:app_id\" content=\"212044188860269\"><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Fever\"><meta id=\"og:type\" property=\"og:type\" content=\"product\"><meta id=\"og:title\" property=\"og:title\" content=\"Taste Film presents Guardians of The Galaxy (2014) - Tickets | Fever\"><meta id=\"twitter:title\" property=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Taste Film presents Guardians of The Galaxy (2014) - Tickets | Fever\"><meta id=\"og:description\" property=\"og:description\" content=\"As the film plays out on screen, you’ll be served a bespoke, cinematic tasting menu inspired by our favourite moments from the film. Get your tickets now!\"><meta id=\"og:url\" property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://feverup.com/m/562307\"><meta id=\"og:image\" property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,ar_15:8,c_fill/fever2/plan/photo/e9f98db6-facc-11f0-94fd-72d51b07f6e7.jpg\"><meta id=\"twitter:site\" property=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@feverapp\"><meta id=\"twitter:description\" property=\"twitter:description\" content=\"As the film plays out on screen, you’ll be served a bespoke, cinematic tasting menu inspired by our favourite moments from the film. Get your tickets now!\"><!--[--><!--[--><!----><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"name\": \"Taste Film presents Guardians of The Galaxy (2014)\",\n  \"description\": \"⭐  Taste Film believes films should be more than just watched - they should be lived, shared, and tasted. Get ready to embark on a journey where fine food and iconic film moments collide, transforming your night out into an unforgettable adventure.    Highlights   🎥 Don’t just watch the film… savour it!  🌌 Enjoy a multi-course menu inspired by the film Guardians of The Galaxy (2014)  🍴 Dine in sync with iconic on-screen moments   General Info   📅 Date: May and June 2026  🕐 Time: Please check your booking for specific event times.  📍 Location: The Refinery Citypoint, EC2Y 9HT  👤 Age rating: this film is rated  12A  (minimum age 12)  ♿ Accessibility: this venue is wheelchair accessible  🍽️ The menu: to view the menu, please click  here   ❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience  here    Description   PRESS PLAY ON THE MIXTAPE. WE’RE ON A MISSION   We’re hooked on a vibe. Taste Film presents Guardians of the Galaxy and we want  you  to join our not-so-merry band of space punks. Do you like Pina Coladas? Same. Come settle in with some spaced-out popcorn and we’ll show you a  good  time.   The Experience   As the film plays out on screen, you’ll be served a bespoke, cinematic tasting menu inspired by our favourite moments from the film.   Expect space food, galactic prison dishes and MARVEL-lous surprises along the way. All designed to bring the world of the film straight to your table.   Packed with delicious courses and unexpected twists, this experience invites you to embrace your inner outlaw \",\n  \"sku\": \"562307\",\n  \"@type\": \"Product\",\n  \"offers\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n      \"name\": \"Taste Film presents Guardians of The Galaxy (2014) - Classic with cocktail\",\n      \"priceCurrency\": \"GBP\",\n      \"price\": 85.8,\n      \"areaServed\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Place\",\n        \"name\": \"The Refinery Citypoint\",\n        \"address\": {\n          \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n          \"addressLocality\": \"London\"\n        },\n        \"geo\": {\n          \"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\",\n          \"latitude\": 51.5190369,\n          \"longitude\": -0.09013779999999998\n        }\n      },\n      \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n      \"url\": \"https://feverup.com/m/562307\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"image\": {\n    \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n    \"c