Q1K\"}},\"google\":{\"storeUrl\":\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.feverup.fever\",\"place\":{\"key\":\"AIzaSyAzz5QA02Lmzl-3YQvjiSvOQmsUKLvuSw4\"},\"maps\":{\"key\":\"AIzaSyDMs02xUjIR6VWW_5Z8XAuLOmRX7HxvlLI\"}},\"queue\":{\"queueIt\":{\"account\":\"feverup\"},\"queuedPlans\":\"\",\"comingSoonPlans\":\"\"},\"fraudDetection\":{\"riskified\":{\"shopDomain\":\"feverup.com\"},\"forter\":{\"siteId\":\"039249618c32\"}}},\"plan-ab-tests\":[{\"value\":\"Taste Film presents Guardians of The Galaxy (2014)\",\"storedData\":{\"key\":\"fv_plan_name_ab_test\",\"value\":{}},\"trackingData\":{\"field\":\"name\"},\"isVariant\":false,\"allowUnsafeHtml\":false},{\"value\":\"⭐ \\\\u003Cem\\\\u003ETaste Film believes films should be more than just watched - they should be lived, shared, and tasted. Get ready to embark on a journey where fine food and iconic film moments collide, transforming your night out into an unforgettable adventure.\\\\u003C/em\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003EHighlights\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 🎥 Don’t just watch the film… savour it!\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 🌌 Enjoy a multi-course menu inspired by the film Guardians of The Galaxy (2014)\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 🍴 Dine in sync with iconic on-screen moments\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003EGeneral Info\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 📅 Date: May and June 2026\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 🕐 Time: Please check your booking for specific event times.\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 📍 Location: The Refinery Citypoint, EC2Y 9HT\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 👤 Age rating: this film is rated \\\\u003Ca href=\\\\u0022https://www.bbfc.co.uk/release/guardians-of-the-galaxy-q29sbgvjdglvbjpwwc0znzk5nzm\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener noreferrer\\\\u0022\\\\u003E12A\\\\u003C/a\\\\u003E (minimum age 12)\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E ♿ Accessibility: this venue is wheelchair accessible\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E 🍽️ The menu: to view the menu, please click \\\\u003Ca href=\\\\u0022https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NWUNP0sxRjZtGJzoxpP74Qy9UQuAKsfF/view?usp=drive_link\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener noreferrer\\\\u0022\\\\u003Ehere\\\\u003C/a\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E ❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience \\\\u003Ca href=\\\\u0022https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSp2K6XG_QIZ2Gg_zrZb2xW9_xXjZJUPTPFAstXgmSUJavlcRlINfSLSKiSYT1VBfylMThAsmy0Fqjs/pub\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener noreferrer\\\\u0022\\\\u003Ehere\\\\u003C/a\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003EDescription\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003EPRESS PLAY ON THE MIXTAPE. WE’RE ON A MISSION\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E We’re hooked on a vibe. Taste Film presents Guardians of the Galaxy and we want \\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003Eyou\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E to join our not-so-merry band of space punks. Do you like Pina Coladas? Same. Come settle in with some spaced-out popcorn and we’ll show you a \\\\u003Cem\\\\u003Egood\\\\u003C/em\\\\u003E time.\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003EThe Experience\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E As the film plays out on screen, you’ll be served a bespoke, cinematic tasting menu inspired by our favourite moments from the film.\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E Expect space food, galactic prison dishes and MARVEL-lous surprises along the way. All designed to bring the world of the film straight to your table.\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E Packed with delicious courses and unexpected twists, this experience invites you to embrace your inner outlaw\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\",\"storedData\":{\"key\":\"fv_plan_description_ab_test\",\"value\":{}},\"trackingData\":{\"field\":\"description\"},\"isVariant\":false,\"allowUnsafeHtml\":false},{\"value\":\"https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,w_720,h_720/fever2/plan/photo/e9f98db6-facc-11f0-94fd-72d51b07f6e7.jpg\",\"storedData\":{\"key\":\"fv_pl