c-38.5-7-77.8 6.6-103.8 35.8l-4.2 4.7-12 13.5c-3 3.4-7.4 5.4-12 5.4s-8.9-2-12-5.4zm34.9-57.1C311 48.4 352.7 37.7 393.7 45.1C462.2 57.6 512 117.3 512 186.9v3.5c0 36-13.1 70.6-36.6 97.5c-3.4 3.8-6.9 7.5-10.7 11l-184 171.3c-.8 .8-1.7 1.5-2.6 2.2c-6.3 4.9-14.1 7.5-22.1 7.5c-9.2 0-18-3.5-24.8-9.7L47.2 299c-3.8-3.5-7.3-7.2-10.7-11C13.1 261 0 226.4 0 190.4v-3.5C0 117.3 49.8 57.6 118.3 45.1c40.9-7.4 82.6 3.2 114.7 28.4c6.7 5.3 13 11.1 18.7 17.6l4.2 4.7 4.2-4.7c4.2-4.7 8.6-9.1 13.3-13.1c1.8-1.5 3.6-3 5.4-4.5z\" class=\"svelte-1ipid5s\"></path></svg><!----></button><!--]--><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> </div> <hr class=\"astro-eulym4nl\"> </div> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/PlanHeroInfo.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.CF3KGTfm.js\"></script>  </div>  <div id=\"plan-description\" class=\"plan-description astro-4r2zdndd\" data-testid=\"plan-content-description\">⭐ <em>Taste Film believes films should be more than just watched - they should be lived, shared, and tasted. Get ready to embark on a journey where fine food and iconic film moments collide, transforming your night out into an unforgettable adventure.</em><br /><br /><strong>Highlights</strong><br /> 🎥 Don’t just watch the film… savour it!<br /> 🌌 Enjoy a multi-course menu inspired by the film Guardians of The Galaxy (2014)<br /> 🍴 Dine in sync with iconic on-screen moments<br /><br /><strong>General Info</strong><br /> 📅 Date: May and June 2026<br /> 🕐 Time: Please check your booking for specific event times.<br /> 📍 Location: The Refinery Citypoint, EC2Y 9HT<br /> 👤 Age rating: this film is rated <a href=\"https://www.bbfc.co.uk/release/guardians-of-the-galaxy-q29sbgvjdglvbjpwwc0znzk5nzm\">12A</a> (minimum age 12)<br /> ♿ Accessibility: this venue is wheelchair accessible<br /> 🍽️ The menu: to view the menu, please click <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NWUNP0sxRjZtGJzoxpP74Qy9UQuAKsfF/view?usp=drive_link\">here</a><br /> ❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSp2K6XG_QIZ2Gg_zrZb2xW9_xXjZJUPTPFAstXgmSUJavlcRlINfSLSKiSYT1VBfylMThAsmy0Fqjs/pub\">here</a><br /><br /><strong>Description</strong><br /><strong>PRESS PLAY ON THE MIXTAPE. WE’RE ON A MISSION</strong><br /> We’re hooked on a vibe. Taste Film presents Guardians of the Galaxy and we want <strong>you</strong> to join our not-so-merry band of space punks. Do you like Pina Coladas? Same. Come settle in with some spaced-out popcorn and we’ll show you a <em>good</em> time.<br /><br /><strong>The Experience</strong><br /> As the film plays out on screen, you’ll be served a bespoke, cinematic tasting menu inspired by our favourite moments from the film.<br /><br /> Expect space food, galactic prison dishes and MARVEL-lous surprises along the way. All designed to bring the world of the film straight to your table.<br /><br /> Packed with delicious courses and unexpected twists, this experience invites you to embrace your inner outlaw<br /></div> <astro-island uid=\"28adMt\" component-url=\"/_astro/HTMLPlanDescriptionExperimentHandler.idEgzVjh.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.svelte.CPQfNHU-.js\" props=\"{&quot;planID&quot;:[0,562307],&quot;class&quot;:[0,&quot;astro-4r2zdndd&quot;]}\" ssr client=\"only\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;HTMLPlanDescriptionExperimentHandler&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;svelte&quot;}\"></astro-island> <astro-island uid=\"mcIqm\" component-url=\"/_astro/HTMLPlanDescriptionTabsHandler.mFbmXKWW.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.svelte.CPQfNHU-.js\" props=\"{&quot;class&quot;:[0,&quot;astro-4r2zdndd&quot;]}\" ssr client=\"only\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;HTMLPlanDescriptionTabsHandler&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;svelte&quot;}\"></astro-island> <astro-island uid=\"Z2wx129\" component-url=\"/_astro/HTMLPlanDescriptionLinkTracking.WlW-Qa2O.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.svelte.CPQfNHU-.js\" props=\"{&quot;trackableUR