Z8XAuLOmRX7HxvlLI\"}},\"queue\":{\"queueIt\":{\"account\":\"feverup\"},\"queuedPlans\":\"\",\"comingSoonPlans\":\"\"},\"fraudDetection\":{\"riskified\":{\"shopDomain\":\"feverup.com\"},\"forter\":{\"siteId\":\"039249618c32\"}}},\"plan-ab-tests\":[{\"value\":\"Taste Film presents The Goonies (1985)\",\"storedData\":{\"key\":\"fv_plan_name_ab_test\",\"value\":{}},\"trackingData\":{\"field\":\"name\"},\"isVariant\":false,\"allowUnsafeHtml\":false},{\"value\":\"⭐ \\\\u003Cem\\\\u003ETaste Film believes films should be more than just watched - they should be lived, shared, and tasted. Get ready to embark on a journey where fine food and iconic film moments collide, transforming your night out into an unforgettable adventure.\\\\u003C/em\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\n\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\n\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003EHighlights\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\n🎥 Don’t just watch the film… savour it!\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\n🏴‍☠️ Enjoy a multi-course menu inspired by the film The Goonies (1985)\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\n🍴 Dine in sync with iconic on-screen moments\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\n\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\n\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003EGeneral Info\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\n📅 Date: April and May 2026\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\n🕐 Time: Please check your booking for specific event times.\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\n📍 Location: Parlour, NW10 5LG\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\n👤 Age rating: this film is rated \\\\u003Ca href=\\\\u0022https://www.bbfc.co.uk/release/the-goonies-q29sbgvjdglvbjpwwc0zmza4mzc\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener noreferrer\\\\u0022\\\\u003E12\\\\u003C/a\\\\u003E (minimum age 5)\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\n♿ Accessibility: This venue is not wheelchair accessible\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\n🍽️ The menu: to view the menu, please click \\\\u003Ca href=\\\\u0022https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Bg62s9KnUy2t2D0MwTmuDhfy5fIUvTZ_/view?usp=drive_link\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener noreferrer\\\\u0022\\\\u003Ehere\\\\u003C/a\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience \\\\u003Ca href=\\\\u0022https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSp2K6XG_QIZ2Gg_zrZb2xW9_xXjZJUPTPFAstXgmSUJavlcRlINfSLSKiSYT1VBfylMThAsmy0Fqjs/pub\\\\u0022 rel=\\\\u0022noopener noreferrer\\\\u0022\\\\u003Ehere\\\\u003C/a\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\n\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\n\\\\u003Cstrong\\\\u003EDescription\\\\u003C/strong\\\\u003E\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\nHey Guys! Join Taste Film for a nostalgic, treasure-hunting cinematic dining adventure, inspired by The Goonies.\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\n\\\\u003Cbr\\\\u003E\\r\\nThis cult 80s classic comes to life through a seven-course menu packed with easter eggs, interactive moments, and unforgettable Italian-American flavours. It’s the PERFECT night out. Perfect for film lovers, foodies, nostalgia seekers, and anyone ready to become a Goonie (or rather… a Foodie).\",\"storedData\":{\"key\":\"fv_plan_description_ab_test\",\"value\":{}},\"trackingData\":{\"field\":\"description\"},\"isVariant\":false,\"allowUnsafeHtml\":false},{\"value\":\"https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,w_720,h_720/fever2/plan/photo/c2432270-facf-11f0-bb32-9e1f27eb2885.jpg\",\"storedData\":{\"key\":\"fv_plan_cover_image_ab_test\",\"value\":{}},\"trackingData\":{\"field\":\"cover_image\"},\"isVariant\":false,\"allowUnsafeHtml\":false}],\"page-config\":{\"name\":\"plan\",\"planDetail\":{\"aBTesting\":null,\"accessRules\":[],\"allowMultiSessionPurchase\":true,\"baseLocale\":\"en-GB\",\"category\":\"\",\"cityAvailableLocales\":[\"en-GB\",\"es-ES\"],\"cityCountryIsoCode\":\"UK\",\"citySlug\":\"london\",\"citySlugLanguage\":\"en\",\"cityStandardId\":1006886,\"coverImage\":\"https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,w_720,h_720/fever2/plan/photo/c2432270-facf-11f0-bb32-9e1f27eb2885.jpg\",\"customLabel\":null,\"defaultLevelDisplay\":\"disabled\",\"defaultPlace\":{\"address\":\"5 Regent Street, London NW10 5LG, .\",\"hasPlacePage\":true,\"hidde