            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"astro-sckkx6r4\"> <head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"> <title>Blockbuster Film Tours at the Old Royal Naval College (London) Tickets | Fever</title><meta id=\"description\" name=\"description\" content=\"Blockbuster Film Tours at the Old Royal Naval College in London. Get your tickets on Fever now!\"><link id=\"canonical\" rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/169360\"><link id=\"alternate:en\" rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/169360\" hreflang=\"x-default\"><link id=\"alternate:en\" rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/169360\" hreflang=\"en\"><link id=\"alternate:es\" rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/169360/es\" hreflang=\"es\"><meta id=\"robots\" name=\"robots\" content=\"index\"><meta name=\"google\" content=\"notranslate\"><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"><meta name=\"mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\"><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\"><meta id=\"al:ios:url\" property=\"al:ios:url\" content=\"fb212044188860269://m/169360\"><meta id=\"al:android:url\" property=\"al:android:url\" content=\"fb212044188860269://m/169360\"><meta id=\"al:android:package\" property=\"al:android:package\" content=\"com.feverup.fever\"><link id=\"apple-touch-icon\" rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"/favicons/apple-touch-icon.png\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"48x48\" href=\"/favicons/favicon-48x48.png\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"/favicons/favicon-32x32.png\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"16x16\" href=\"/favicons/favicon-16x16.png\"><link rel=\"mask-icon\" href=\"/favicons/favicon-safari-pinned-tab.svg\" color=\"#10212e\"><link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/favicons/shortcut-favicon.ico\"><meta name=\"msapplication-config\" content=\"/browserconfig.xml\"><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://applications-media.feverup.com\"><meta name=\"msapplication-TileColor\" content=\"#10212e\"><meta name=\"msapplication-config\" content=\"/browserconfig.xml\"><meta property=\"fb:app_id\" content=\"212044188860269\"><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Fever\"><meta id=\"og:type\" property=\"og:type\" content=\"product\"><meta id=\"og:title\" property=\"og:title\" content=\"Blockbuster Film Tours at the Old Royal Naval College (London) Tickets | Fever\"><meta id=\"twitter:title\" property=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Blockbuster Film Tours at the Old Royal Naval College (London) Tickets | Fever\"><meta id=\"og:description\" property=\"og:description\" content=\"Blockbuster Film Tours at the Old Royal Naval College in London. Get your tickets on Fever now!\"><meta id=\"og:url\" property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://feverup.com/m/169360\"><meta id=\"og:image\" property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,ar_15:8,c_fill/fever2/plan/photo/90d5c18a-f8f5-11ee-82f5-bed011be9325\"><meta id=\"twitter:site\" property=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@feverapp\"><meta id=\"twitter:description\" property=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Blockbuster Film Tours at the Old Royal Naval College in London. Get your tickets on Fever now!\"><!--[--><!--[--><!----><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"name\": \"Blockbuster Film Tours at the Old Royal Naval College\",\n  \"description\": \" 📱 Smartphone tickets \\n⚡ Instant access to your tickets  \\n \\n\\n\\n    ⏳ Duration: 1h 30m \\n\\n\\n    👉 Experience available in English \\n\\n\\n    &nbsp; \\n\\n\\n\\n     Dive into the cinematic universe at the Old Royal Naval College and discover why it's a favorite backdrop for blockbuster hits! From the breathtaking Painted Hall to the enchanting Chapel, see where iconic scenes from The Crown, Les Misérables, Thor, and more were brought to life. Uncover secrets of the trade on a tour that's as informative as it is magical, making your way through nearly a century of film history. Tours are available on weekends, perfect for a unique outing. Get your tickets for Blockbuster Film Tours at the Old Royal Naval College! \\n     &nbsp;\\n\\n\\n\\n     Highlights   \\n    🎬 Dive into the heart of iconic film scenes at the Painted Hall & Chapel. 🌟 Explore the favorite backdrop of blockbusters like The Crown & Bridgerton. 📽️ Get exclusive insights with behind-the-scenes tours every weekend.\\n     &nbsp;\\n\\n\\n\\n     What's included?   \\n    ✔️ Join our standard site tours departing hourly from the visitor centre (11am-3pm).   ✔️ Entry to the Visitor Centre of artefacts is included.   ✔️ The tour takes you into the Chapel of St Peter and St Paul.   ✔️ Entry to the Painted Hall and the Nelson Room.   ✔️ Entry to Victorian Skittle Alley (subject to opening, please check on arrival).   ✔️ Guided Blockbuster Film & TV Tour, lasting 60 minutes. \\n     &nbsp;\\n\\n\\n\\n       Itinerary   \\n      Old Royal Naval College  -  Admission included  \\n The Painted Hall  -  Admission included    \\n    &nbsp; \\n\\n\\n\\n     Additional Information   \\n    ♿ Wheelchair accessible and transportation options include accessible facilities.   👶 Infants and small children are welcome in a pram or stroller.   🐕 Service animals are permitted on this experience.   🚆 Public transportation options are conveniently located nearby.   🏋️‍♂️ This experience is suitable for all physical fitness levels.   🔊 An Audio Guide featuring British Sign Language is available. \\n     &nbsp;\\n\\n\\n   Why choose Fever?   \\n    ✔️ Millions of users book every month. \\n                ✔️ The best prices and availability at all times. \\n                ✔️ Thousands of unique experiences. \\n                ✔️ Verified user reviews. \\n                ✔️ 24/7 customer service. \\n                \\n &nbsp;\\n\\n \\n Experience supplied by Old Royal Naval College  \\n All ticket sales are final and cannot be refunded, exchanged, or otherwise modified. Click here to check out&nbsp; the T&amp;Cs . \",\n  \"sku\": \"169360\",\n  \"@type\": \"Product\",\n  \"offers\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n      \"name\": \"Blockbuster Film Tours at the Old Royal Naval College - Blockbuster Film Tours - Old Royal Naval College, Greenwich | Adult (17 - 100) - £16.50\",\n      \"priceCurrency\": \"GBP\",\n      \"price\": 0,\n      \"areaServed\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Place\",\n        \"name\": \"43 King William Walk\",\n        \"address\": {\n          \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n          \"addressLocality\": \"London\"\n        },\n        \"geo\": {\n          \"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\",\n          \"latitude\": 51.482429,\n          \"longitude\": -0.0092578\n        }\n      },\n      \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n      \"url\": \"https://feverup.com/m/169360\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"image\": {\n    \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n    \"contentUrl\": \"https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,w_720,h_720/fever2/plan/photo/90d5c18a-f8f5-11ee-82f5-bed011be9325\",\n    \"contentLocation\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Place\",\n      \"geo\": {\n        \"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\",\n        \"latitude\": 51.482429,\n        \"longitude\": -0.0092578\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}</script><!----><!----><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"name\": \"Blockbuster Film Tours at the Old Royal Naval College\",\n  \"description\": \" 📱 Smartphone tickets \\n⚡ Instant access to your tickets  \\n \\n\\n\\n    ⏳ Duration: 1h 30m \\n\\n\\n    👉 Experience available in English \\n\\n\\n    &nbsp; \\n\\n\\n\\n     Dive into the cinematic universe at the Old Royal Naval College and discover why it's a favorite backdrop for blockbuster hits! From the breathtaking Painted Hall to the enchanting Chapel, see where iconic scenes from The Crown, Les Misérables, Thor, and more were brought to life. Uncover secrets of the trade on a tour that's as informative as it is magical, making your way through nearly a century of film history. Tours are available on weekends, perfect for a unique outing. Get your tickets for Blockbuster Film Tours at the Old Royal Naval College! \\n     &nbsp;\\n\\n\\n\\n     Highlights   \\n    🎬 Dive into the heart of iconic film scenes at the Painted Hall & Chapel. 🌟 Explore the favorite backdrop of blockbusters like The Crown & Bridgerton. 📽️ Get exclusive insights with behind-the-scenes tours every weekend.\\n     &nbsp;\\n\\n\\n\\n     What's included?   \\n    ✔️ Join our standard site tours departing hourly from the visitor centre (11am-3pm).   ✔️ Entry to the Visitor Centre of artefacts is included.   ✔️ The tour takes you into the Chapel of St Peter and St Paul.   ✔️ Entry to the Painted Hall and the Nelson Room.   ✔️ Entry to Victorian Skittle Alley (subject to opening, please check on arrival).   ✔️ Guided Blockbuster Film & TV Tour, lasting 60 minutes. \\n     &nbsp;\\n\\n\\n\\n       Itinerary   \\n      Old Royal Naval College  -  Admission included  \\n The Painted Hall  -  Admission included    \\n    &nbsp; \\n\\n\\n\\n     Additional Information   \\n    ♿ Wheelchair accessible and transportation options include accessible facilities.   👶 Infants and small children are welcome in a pram or stroller.   🐕 Service animals are permitted on this experience.   🚆 Public transportation options are conveniently located nearby.   🏋️‍♂️ This experience is suitable for all physical fitness levels.   🔊 An Audio Guide featuring British Sign Language is available. \\n     &nbsp;\\n\\n\\n   Why choose Fever?   \\n    ✔️ Millions of users book every month. \\n                ✔️ The best prices and availability at all times. \\n                ✔️ Thousands of unique experiences. \\n                ✔️ Verified user reviews. \\n                ✔️ 24/7 customer service. \\n                \\n &nbsp;\\n\\n \\n Experience supplied by O