path></svg><!----></button><!--]--><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> </div> <hr class=\"astro-eulym4nl\"> </div> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/PlanHeroInfo.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.CF3KGTfm.js\"></script>  </div>  <div id=\"plan-description\" class=\"plan-description astro-4r2zdndd\" data-testid=\"plan-content-description\"><strong>📱 Smartphone tickets<br />\n⚡ Instant access to your tickets</strong><br />\n<br />\n\n\n    ⏳ Duration: 1h 30m<br />\n\n\n    👉 Experience available in English<br />\n\n\n     <br />\n\n\n\n    <em>Dive into the cinematic universe at the Old Royal Naval College and discover why it's a favorite backdrop for blockbuster hits! From the breathtaking Painted Hall to the enchanting Chapel, see where iconic scenes from The Crown, Les Misérables, Thor, and more were brought to life. Uncover secrets of the trade on a tour that's as informative as it is magical, making your way through nearly a century of film history. Tours are available on weekends, perfect for a unique outing. Get your tickets for Blockbuster Film Tours at the Old Royal Naval College!</em>\n    <br /> \n\n\n\n  <hr /><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><strong>Highlights</strong></span><br />\n    🎬 Dive into the heart of iconic film scenes at the Painted Hall &amp; Chapel.<br />🌟 Explore the favorite backdrop of blockbusters like The Crown &amp; Bridgerton.<br />📽️ Get exclusive insights with behind-the-scenes tours every weekend.\n    <br /> \n\n\n\n  <hr /><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><strong>What's included?</strong></span><br />\n    ✔️ Join our standard site tours departing hourly from the visitor centre (11am-3pm).  <br />✔️ Entry to the Visitor Centre of artefacts is included.  <br />✔️ The tour takes you into the Chapel of St Peter and St Paul.  <br />✔️ Entry to the Painted Hall and the Nelson Room.  <br />✔️ Entry to Victorian Skittle Alley (subject to opening, please check on arrival).  <br />✔️ Guided Blockbuster Film &amp; TV Tour, lasting 60 minutes.<br />\n    <br /> \n\n\n\n    <hr /><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><strong>Itinerary</strong></span><br />\n    <ul><li>Old Royal Naval College  - <em>Admission included</em></li>\n<li>The Painted Hall  - <em>Admission included</em></li></ul><br />\n     <br />\n\n\n\n  <hr /><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><strong>Additional Information</strong></span><br />\n    ♿ Wheelchair accessible and transportation options include accessible facilities.  <br />👶 Infants and small children are welcome in a pram or stroller.  <br />🐕 Service animals are permitted on this experience.  <br />🚆 Public transportation options are conveniently located nearby.  <br />🏋️‍♂️ This experience is suitable for all physical fitness levels.  <br />🔊 An Audio Guide featuring British Sign Language is available.<br />\n    <br /> \n\n\n<hr /><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><strong>Why choose Fever?</strong></span><br />\n    ✔️ Millions of users book every month.<br />\n                ✔️ The best prices and availability at all times.<br />\n                ✔️ Thousands of unique experiences.<br />\n                ✔️ Verified user reviews.<br />\n                ✔️ 24/7 customer service.<br />\n                \n<br /> \n\n<hr />\n<em>Experience supplied by Old Royal Naval College</em><br />\n<em>All ticket sales are final and cannot be refunded, exchanged, or otherwise modified. Click here to check out <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSVRJ1Z5-8gFm17oKLfc1rcA_HQk0tfJdZ8J4EOwBjPOBrfX-AvXaaGoq7vPNos-r2V4U4PxCfXUyar/pub\" target=\"_blank\">the T&amp;Cs</a>.</em></div> <astro-island uid=\"KBaMl\" component-url=\"/_astro/HTMLPlanDescriptionExperimentHandler.idEgzVjh.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.svelte.CPQfNHU-.js\" props=\"{&quot;planID&quot;:[0,169360],&quot;class&quot;:[0,&quot;astro-4r2zdndd&quot;]}\" ssr client=\"only\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;HTMLPlanDescriptionExperimentHandler&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;svelte&quot;}\"></astro-island> <astro-island uid=\"mcIqm\" component-url=\"/_astro/HTMLPlanDescriptionTabsHandler.mFbmXKWW.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.svelte.CPQfNHU-.js\" props=\"{&quot;class&quot;:[0,&quot;astro-4r2zdndd&quot;]}\" ssr client=\"only\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;HTMLPlanDescriptionTabsHandler&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;svelte&quot;}\"></astro-island>       <script>(()=>{var a=(s,i,o)=>{let r=async()=>{await(await s())()},t=typeof i.value==\"object\"?i.value:void 0,c={rootMargin:t==null?void 0:t.rootMargin},n=new IntersectionObserver(e=>{for(let l of e)if(l.isIntersecting){n.disconnect(),r();break}},c);for(let e of o.children)n.observe(e)};(self.Astro||(self.Astro={})).visible=a;window.dispatchEvent(new Event(\"astro:visible\"));})();</script><!--[--><section class=\"plan-content__block svelte-vu3cyy\" data-testid=\"plan-content-help\"><!----> <!--[--><h2 class=\"plan-content__block-title svelte-cwjbxa\"><!----> <!--[--><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-user-headset svelte-1ipid5s\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M224 32C135.6 32 64 103.6 64 192v16c0 8.8-7.2 16-16 16s-16-7.2-16-16V192C32 86 118 0 224 0S416 86 416 192v16c0 61.9-50.1 112-112 112H240 224 208c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32s14.3-32 32-32h32c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32h32c44.2 0 80-35.8 80-80V192c0-88.4-71.6-160-160-160zm0 32c70.7 0 128 57.3 128 128c0 13.9-2.2 27.3-6.3 39.8C337.4 246.3 321.8 256 304 256h-8.4c15.2-17 24.4-39.4 24.4-64c0-53-43-96-96-96s-96 43-96 96c0 24.6 9.3 47.1 24.5 64.1c-5.4 9.4-8.5 20.3-8.5 31.9c0 1.4 0 2.7 .1 4C114.8 268.6 96 232.5 96 192c0-70.7 57.3-128 128-128zM208 352h16 16 64 9.6C387.8 352 448 412.2 448 486.4c0 14.1-11.5 25.6-25.6 25.6H25.6C11.5 512 0 500.5 0 486.4C0 412.2 60.2 352 134.4 352H208zm105.6 32H134.4C80 384 35.5 426.4 32.2 480H415.8c-3.3-53.6-47.8-96-102.2-96z\" class=\"svelte-1ipid5s\"></path></svg><!--]--> Need help?<!----></h2